<title>USA: Hutchinson Technology sets 3-for-1 split.</title>
<headline>Hutchinson Technology sets 3-for-1 split.</headline>
<dateline>HUTCHINSON, Minn. 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hutchinson Technology Inc said Monday its board had approved a three-for-one stock split, payable February 11, record January 31.</p>
</text>
